    "body": "Inventory: every native file/folder dialog in the UI, and what the wasm32 build does with it today (main at 936172d8a).\n\nAll pickers go through `crates/ui/src/file_dialog.rs` (`FileDialog`). On wasm32 its `pick_file` / `save_file` / `pick_folder` log \"dialog is not available in the browser build yet (#31): treated as cancelled\" and return `None`, so every row below is a silent no-op in the browser today (the log is not on screen). The `*File(path)` script arms fail by name on wasm because `std::fs` answers Unsupported there.\n\n| Command / control | Where | Dialog | Browser today | This PR |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Open Model (ribbon, Ctrl+O) | `OpenModelDialog`, state.rs `pick_mesh_file` | open | no-op | darkened, tip + status: needs the browser file picker (#31 / PR #1314) |\n| Open project (ribbon, Ctrl+Shift+O) | `OpenProjectDialog`, `pick_project_file` | open | no-op | same |\n| Open recent (ribbon lists) | `OpenRecent` | none (fs) | fails on fs | refused: the browser keeps no recent files |\n| Save (Ctrl+S) | `SaveProjectDialog`, `save_project_dialog` | save | no-op | **downloads** `<name>.camproj`, marks clean |\n| Save As (Ctrl+Shift+S) | `SaveProjectAsDialog` | save | no-op | **downloads** under a prompted name |\n| Unsaved prompt: Save | unsaved.rs `resolve_unsaved` | save | no-op, document kept | **downloads**, then goes on |\n| Post (ribbon, Ctrl+P) | `PostProgramDialog` -> state_per_op.rs | save | no-op | **downloads** the gated `.nc`; refusal window as on desktop |\n| Post, one file per operation | `PostProgramDialog` (per-op) | folder | no-op | darkened, tip + status: needs a folder; switch Output |\n| Load post (.cps) | `SelectPostDialog`, `pick_post_file` | open | no-op | button greyed with reason |\n| Load machine (.mch) / Load other | `LoadMachineDialog`, `pick_machine_file` | open | no-op | buttons greyed with reason |\n| Theme dropdown \"Browse...\" | `SelectThemeDialog`, `pick_theme_file` | open | no-op | refused on the status line (row has no disabled state) |\n| Import fixture (page button, tree menu) | `ImportFixtureDialog`, `pick_mesh_file` | open | no-op | page button greyed; menu row refused on status line |\n| Fixture library save / insert | `FixtureLibrarySaveDialog` / `InsertDialog` | none (user folder) | fails on fs | refused on status line |\n| Tool library export / import | state_tool_library.rs | save / open | no-op | buttons greyed with reason |\n| Tool body import | state_tool_body.rs `import_tool_body_dialog` | open | no-op | button greyed with reason |\n| Setup sheet export | `SetupSheetDialog`, `save_sheet_dialog` | save | no-op | button greyed (export not a download yet) |\n| Tool list export | `ToolListExportDialog` | save | no-op | button greyed (export not a download yet) |\n| Stock STL export | `ExportStockDialog`, `save_stl_dialog` | save | no-op | button greyed (export not a download yet) |\n\nOpen paths stay owed to PR #1314 (a contributor's fork branch; this work is not stacked on it). The other exports as downloads are filed as a follow-up.\n",
