    "body": "Work stops because automatic approval review rejected git push -u origin issue/1431-browser-menu-refusals: approval required by policy, but AskForApproval is set to Never.\n\nThe fix is committed locally as c07d8ac7 on issue/1431-browser-menu-refusals. The worktree is .claude/worktrees/issue-1431. No PR was created.\n\nBoth structural pins failed before the fix and pass after it: browser_theme_browse_is_disabled_with_a_reason and browser_fixture_file_rows_are_disabled_with_reasons. Restoring each original menu file made its pin fail; restoring the fix made it pass. The quick gate and UI clippy passed. No goldens changed. PR #1639 touches structural.rs in different functions. No browser session or wasm compilation ran.\n\nReleasing this claim. The local commit and worktree remain available for a permitted push.\n",
